# Part 1: the kitchen

INTERVIEWER
How often do the biscuits run out?

ANNA
(laughs)
Every day, really. By ten o'clock the tin is empty.

INTERVIEWER
And who refills it?

ANNA
Nobody admits to it. It just happens.

!Pause. She looks at the tin.

